# Machine-specific access notes. Untracked from 2026-09-12, after sitting in
# 274 commits with the SSH user, the key path, a Tailscale address and an
# employer's VPN network in them. None of it was a credential, which is why it
# went unnoticed for so long -- reading the file did not feel like reading a
# secret. It stays ON DISK, because that is where its value is; it is only the
# history of a repository with a remote that it has no business being in.
# install/release/check_staged_clean.py refuses a commit that brings it back.
.context/MAC_CONNECTION.md
*.ovpn
